WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.842
That child

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:11.637
has a very unique brain.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:15.807
A new type of genius.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:24.399
We all want to know what other
people think and feel.

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:27.277
You're saying we can access...

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:29.988
... a person's memories and
thoughts?

00:00:30.906 --> 00:00:32.491
Why do we need this?

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:52.970
You are talking about hacking
into brains?

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:54.888
Show me what you know.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:00.769
Find our son.

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:04.439
I think I saw something.

00:01:31.842 --> 00:01:34.386
You're a murder suspect we're
keeping an eye on.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:42.352
The memories of the deceased
are tangled in my head.

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:48.650
Was there something strange
about your son’s accident?

00:01:52.154 --> 00:01:55.198
His memories went straight
inside you?

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.035
The memories

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:00.746
feel like hallucinations.

00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:03.081
My mind is in chaos.

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:05.542
Find our son.

